(724, 63, 1007, 'CityUHK Outstanding Athletes Entrance Scholarship (OAES) for Non-Local Students', 'available', 'Sports talent-based', 'Up to HK$250,000 per year: full tuition for undergraduates (normal duration, max 4 years) plus the Residence Scholarship covering hall fees; full/partial tuition for one year only for master''s candidates', true, false, 'Elite competitive sports performance in one of 18 listed sports', 'Non-local UG/master''s athletes: apply for admission by 15 January 2027, then the OAES form (coach/manager recommendation, transcripts incl. TOEFL/IELTS, sports CV with official-match videos, physician''s letter) by 30 January 2027. Panel selection; renewal on satisfactory sports performance + CGPA 2.5+. Not stackable with the Diversity Grant.', 'https://www.cityu.edu.hk/sds/physical-education-wellness-and-sports/student-athletes-admission/outstanding-athletes-entrance', 'https://www.cityu.edu.hk/sds/physical-education-wellness-and-sports/student-athletes-admission/outstanding-athletes-entrance', 'verified', '2026-10-30 10:00:00+05');

